        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-10-31T21:00:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just to get it off my chest: Steel is made by mixing iron and&nbsp;<em>carbon</em>.&nbsp; Iron and&nbsp;<em>oxygen</em>&nbsp;makes rust, which is neither difficult to make nor particularly useful in tool-making.</p>",
